  "description": ".NET for Android / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog Android SDK's dd-sdk-android-session-replay module: Session Replay recording, with the TextAndInputPrivacy, ImagePrivacy and TouchPrivacy masking levels applied on the device before anything is uploaded. Built against dd-sdk-android 2.26.3. Requires RUM - add DatadogNet.RUM.Android. Add DatadogNet.SessionReplayMaterial.Android or DatadogNet.SessionReplayCompose.Android for apps built on Material Components or Jetpack Compose.",
